<title>BELGIUM: EU clears Itafinco deal.</title>
<headline>EU clears Itafinco deal.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Tuesday it had cleared a deal under which French bank Caisse National du Credit Agricole (CNCA), Banco Ambrosiano Veneto Spa and Banque Sofinco take joint control of Italian consumer credit company Agos Itafinco.</p>
<p>The European Union executive said the agreement would not create or strengthen a dominant position.</p>
<p>-- Brussels newsroom +32 2 287 68 11</p>
